type: software
title: "botanical-name (PHP): parse, normalize and format botanical plant names"
abstract: >-
  Parse, normalize and format botanical plant names following the ICN and
  ICNCP: hybrids, infraspecific ranks, authors, cultivar groups, trade
  designations and cultivars, with correct italics in HTML. Zero dependencies.
